### PerCP-Cy5.5

Having swapped out the degraded tandem degradation signature, lets tackle a couple fluorophores that both the signature comparisons and [Luciernaga](/course/SDY3080/LuciernagaIntegration.qmd) walkthrough had flagged as having incorporated autofluorescence in their overall signature. In interest of time, we will focus on just a couple of these for now, starting with PerCP-Cy5.5. 

![](images/InitialPerCP.png)

Compared to to the reference, our cell signature has slight variation to peaks, and a bit of autofluorescence leftover peaks around V7, UV7 and B3. 

